 before"}, {"title": "Best Under 18''s", "description": "If we have any underaged entries we will present an award to the highest score for an Under 18''s category"}, {"title": "Any single player can only win one of the above prizes. In the scenario in which you might win two prizes, the judges will pick a runner up who will be awarded that prize. Players who are eligible for multiple prizes will be given the prize with the most value.", "description": ""}]}'::jsonb
